>> f1 := Ntaub-ntawv tshiab: ['notafile'].
>> f2 := Ntaub-ntawv tshiab: ['/tmp/test.txt'].
(f2 muaj-nyob) tseeb: { f2 rho-tawm.}.
Tawm sau-ntawv: f2 txoj-kev-ntaub-ntawv.
f2 sau-ntawv: ['Hello!'].
f2 ntxiv-tom-kawg: ['World!'].
Tawm sau-ntawv: f2 nyeem.
(f2 muaj-nyob) tseeb: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['!']. }.
(f1 muaj-nyob) tseeb: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['!']. }.
Tawm sau-ntawv: f2 qhov-loj-me, sau-ntawv: f1 qhov-loj-me.
f2 rho-tawm. Tawm sau-ntawv: f2 qhov-loj-me.

